WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.250
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.958
that a jñānī, whose relationship with Krishna

3
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:38.000
is completely selfless and only of devotion

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.416
and surrender,

5
00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.250
they consider them as their own form.

6
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.750
Hearing this, it may seem that then

7
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.958
obtaining knowledge

8
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.375
is like obtaining Krishna.

9
00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:50.750
This sounds so simple,

10
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.166
but here the talk is of

11
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:54.458
such a supreme level of knowledge

12
00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:56.333
which is very extraordinary.

13
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:57.875
Lord Krishna is now

14
00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:01.500
explaining this very thing in
 this nineteenth verse.

15
00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:07.500
In this verse,

16
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.083
Lord Krishna says

17
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.375
that only after many births,

18
00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:12.791
a jñānī person,

19
00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:14.541
considering Krishna as everything,

20
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.541
comes to His shelter

21
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:18.333
with complete surrender.

22
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:21.291
And such a mahātmā is very rare.

23
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:22.375
In this verse, Krishna is explaining

24
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:24.000
a long spiritual journey

25
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.125
lasting many births,

26
00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:27.083
and after that,

27
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:31.083
the final goal of awakened pure devotion.

28
00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:34.250
The word jñānī seems quite simple,

29
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:37.958
 but the jñānī that Krishna was explaining
 in the previous few verses,

30
00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:40.000
the level of that knowledge is extraordinary.

31
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.666
And many births

32
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:43.541
are taken to obtain it.

33
00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:46.208
And only after such many births does that jñānī

34
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:49.250
mahātmā truly understand

35
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.916
that Vāsudeva, meaning Krishna,
 is the foundation

36
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:54.625
of entire creation.

37
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:57.833
Let's understand the parts of this verse...

38
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:02.000
'Bahūnāṁ janmanām ante' means that

39
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.041
to reach this state

40
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.708
many births' time is taken.

41
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:09.958
Initially, many people turn toward
 Krishna because of crisis,

42
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:13.750
desire for wealth, curiosity, or knowledge,

43
00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.458
but they don't yet have this
 complete understanding

44
00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:18.416
that Krishna is everything.

45
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:19.125
This understanding

46
00:02:19.125 --> 00:02:20.666
comes slowly from the merit

47
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:25.041
and spiritual progress of many births.

48
00:02:25.041 --> 00:02:28.375
'Jñānavān māṁ prapadyate,'

49
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:29.333
meaning

50
00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:32.333
the person who has this true knowledge

51
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:35.250
comes to My shelter completely.

52
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.916
This knowledge isn't limited to intellect,

53
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:42.416
but is an experience of deep devotion.

54
00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:45.291
'Vāsudevaḥ sarvam iti,'

55
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:46.250
meaning

56
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.583
this jñānī who has come after traveling the
 knowledge journey of births

57
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:52.041
sees Krishna in every thing.

58
00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:54.625
The entire world is Krishna's power,

59
00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:57.541
they believe this.

60
00:02:57.541 --> 00:02:59.750
'Sa mahātmā sudurlabhaḥ,'

61
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.000
meaning such jñānī mahātmās

62
00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.041
are extremely rare.

63
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:04.583
Many times

64
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:08.583
devotion and knowledge seem
 like quite simple words to hear.

65
00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:11.458
But the knowledge and devotion
 that's being talked about here

66
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:16.750
is completely pure, and that's why it's rare.

67
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.583
This verse shows that from initial devotion

68
00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:22.875
the journey to complete surrender is very long.

69
00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:24.708
But understanding Vāsudeva

70
00:03:24.708 --> 00:03:28.041
and coming to His shelter
 takes a being to liberation

71
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:31.083
and the true joy of the soul.

72
00:03:31.083 --> 00:03:32.083
And certainly,

73
00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:33.958
a jñānī devotee who has come

74
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:38.166
after traveling so many births is
 also extremely dear to Krishna.

75
00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.333
All people who've come

76
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.333
to My shelter are dear to Me,

77
00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:49.958
but

78
00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:51.041
that jñānī who,

79
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:54.208
after traveling many births,

80
00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:57.708
has now known My truth,

81
00:03:57.708 --> 00:04:00.208
has known that

82
00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:04.625
I am the beginning and end of this world,

83
00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:05.875
that one who is

84
00:04:05.875 --> 00:04:10.791
surrendered to Me with complete
 devotion and love,

85
00:04:10.791 --> 00:04:14.500
certainly they're extremely dear to Me.

86
00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:19.416
Many changes, many births are the result

87
00:04:19.416 --> 00:04:22.500
for a jñānī to reach

88
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.750
this extraordinary level.

89
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:29.000
Spiritual progress of this level

90
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.333
doesn't happen quickly,

91
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:34.541
a very long time is taken.

92
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:39.083
Similarly, in life, bringing change
 through your personal progress

93
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:42.708
and self-examination is also

94
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:45.750
a long-time process

95
00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.541
that cannot be done in haste.

96
00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:51.375
Often humans

97
00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:52.583
are eager for results

98
00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:56.458
obtained quickly,

99
00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:58.791
but forget that

100
00:04:58.791 --> 00:05:04.041
even if the foundation of a permanent
 building isn't directly visible,

101
00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:07.750
time is taken to establish it,

102
00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:11.750
and that very foundation
 keeps that building stable

103
00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.416
and firm.

104
00:05:13.416 --> 00:05:14.541
Every step,

105
00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:18.541
every experience is building your
 progress's foundation,

106
00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:23.750
even if you can't experience
 this change immediately.

107
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:27.625
Sometimes it feels progress has stopped,

108
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:28.708
or the change

109
00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:30.041
you want

110
00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:32.625
is being delayed.

111
00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:35.500
But this is the matter of faith –

112
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.083
that if you're continuously making your efforts

113
00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:40.583
from true heart,

114
00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:44.416
then progress is also happening continuously.

115
00:05:44.416 --> 00:05:48.291
Only showing its results will take

116
00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:50.875
a little time.

117
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:53.166
The main thing is

118
00:05:53.166 --> 00:05:56.458
patience and dedication.

119
00:05:56.458 --> 00:06:01.416
Keep the resolve to walk on your path.

120
00:06:01.416 --> 00:06:04.166
Nothing is hidden from Me. Neither

121
00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:07.375
any jñānī's journey of many births,

122
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:11.250
nor your every effort that

123
00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.208
you're making to become

124
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:15.458
a better person.

125
00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.250
Keep patience

126
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.708
and maintain affection in your journey,

127
00:06:20.708 --> 00:06:22.791
maintain devotion,

128
00:06:22.791 --> 00:06:26.000
keep increasing the perspective of spirituality.

129
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.833
At the right time, the result of your every effort

130
00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:33.541
will be before you.

131
00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.208
A jñānī,

132
00:06:40.208 --> 00:06:42.625
after traveling many births,

133
00:06:42.625 --> 00:06:45.416
reaches that extraordinary level

134
00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:49.333
where in their mind there's complete surrender,

135
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:50.458
devotion,

136
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:54.333
not even a trace of ego.

137
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:55.708
And they consider the

138
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.000
loving relationship between Me and them

139
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.041
as everything,

140
00:07:02.041 --> 00:07:04.708
know Me as the source of their life,

141
00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:07.583
of this universe.

142
00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:09.250
In family life,

143
00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:13.958
many things are worth learning from a jñānī.

144
00:07:13.958 --> 00:07:15.375
A jñānī

145
00:07:15.375 --> 00:07:18.250
considers Me the foundation of this universe,

146
00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.375
and therefore

147
00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:22.791
surrenders completely to Me.

148
00:07:22.791 --> 00:07:27.833
It’s quite logical, right,
 that what’s the foundation

149
00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:30.416
is important.

150
00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:33.958
So the foundation of family relationships

151
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:38.625
is love and compassion. Know these as important,

152
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:39.833
and bring love

153
00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:43.333
and compassion in your behavior.

154
00:07:43.333 --> 00:07:46.458
A jñānī knows

155
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:50.375
that I am nourishing this creation.

156
00:07:50.375 --> 00:07:53.333
Toward one who nourishes them,

157
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:56.250
they're completely grateful.

158
00:07:56.250 --> 00:08:00.083
Those people who are nourishing your life,

159
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:04.666
are you completely grateful toward them?

160
00:08:04.666 --> 00:08:07.583
This matter often gets overlooked,

161
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:09.333
but there are many people

162
00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:13.166
who are nourishing your life.

163
00:08:13.166 --> 00:08:16.708
Parents who give their time and labor

164
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:19.291
for your education,

165
00:08:19.291 --> 00:08:22.333
your life's progress.

166
00:08:22.333 --> 00:08:26.500
Siblings who nourish you with love,

167
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.458
and also many times sacrifice their time of joy

168
00:08:30.458 --> 00:08:33.875
to help you.

169
00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.708
If you think deeply,

170
00:08:36.708 --> 00:08:40.041
many examples of this will be found.

171
00:08:40.041 --> 00:08:44.541
So remain grateful toward
 people who nourish you,

172
00:08:44.541 --> 00:08:47.000
and like a jñānī,

173
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:51.250
abandon your ego before them.

174
00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.000
A jñānī 

175
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:59.125
does My devotion, loves Me without
 any material expectation.

176
00:08:59.125 --> 00:09:04.750
You also develop selfless
 love toward your family.

177
00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.875
Don't think what you'll obtain in this,

178
00:09:08.875 --> 00:09:14.458
think what you can give to family members.

179
00:09:14.458 --> 00:09:16.875
The power of family relationships

180
00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:18.958
isn't in material success,

181
00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:19.875
but 

182
00:09:19.875 --> 00:09:24.083
in love and compassion toward each other.

183
00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:26.708
Is in abandoning ego.

184
00:09:26.708 --> 00:09:29.416
Family love and satisfaction

185
00:09:29.416 --> 00:09:32.750
isn't in obtaining something
 from family members,

186
00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.083
it's in dedicating something to them.

187
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:40.458
Think about these things and act on them.

188
00:09:40.458 --> 00:09:42.291
Your relationships also,

189
00:09:42.291 --> 00:09:44.125
your life also,

190
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:48.041
both will become pleasant and prosperous.

191
00:09:52.583 --> 00:09:57.000
A jñānī has understood Me.

192
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.083
Has understood this creation's foundation.

193
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:04.250
They've understood how slowly,

194
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.083
after many births,

195
00:10:06.083 --> 00:10:08.666
they obtained this level.

196
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:11.458
And because of this deep understanding,

197
00:10:11.458 --> 00:10:15.958
they've completely abandoned ego,

198
00:10:15.958 --> 00:10:18.708
they know the importance of patience,

199
00:10:18.708 --> 00:10:22.125
they're desirous not to accomplish
 some selfishness

200
00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:26.166
but only to surrender.

201
00:10:26.166 --> 00:10:28.000
In professional life too,

202
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.833
many things can be learned from this.

203
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:34.458
Just like a jñānī,

204
00:10:34.458 --> 00:10:39.083
for a senior officer who leads an organization,

205
00:10:39.083 --> 00:10:41.875
most important is

206
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:44.750
on one side to have deep understanding,

207
00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:48.541
and on the other side to abandon ego.

208
00:10:48.541 --> 00:10:51.291
And the person appointed to
 the position of leadership

209
00:10:51.291 --> 00:10:55.083
who has obtained these two things

210
00:10:55.083 --> 00:10:57.750
will obtain everything.

211
00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:01.125
Their deep understanding will tell them

212
00:11:01.125 --> 00:11:04.125
that all colleagues' thinking is different,

213
00:11:04.125 --> 00:11:06.166
everyone's purpose is different.

214
00:11:06.166 --> 00:11:07.583
This thing will help them

215
00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:11.333
understand others' perspective

216
00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:13.166
and inspire to give right

217
00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:16.833
encouragement according to the person.

218
00:11:16.833 --> 00:11:17.666
That officer

219
00:11:17.666 --> 00:11:22.208
will also know that their work is only to give.

220
00:11:22.208 --> 00:11:25.041
Give training, give cooperation,

221
00:11:25.041 --> 00:11:28.500
give respect, give others right counsel

222
00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.000
for progress.

223
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:35.541
And one who has learned this
 giving in professional life,

224
00:11:35.541 --> 00:11:40.125
will automatically get others' support.

225
00:11:40.125 --> 00:11:41.125
And yes,

226
00:11:41.125 --> 00:11:44.708
there's absolutely no place for ego here.

227
00:11:44.708 --> 00:11:47.833
You're doing all this because

228
00:11:47.833 --> 00:11:50.875
this is the duty of a person appointed

229
00:11:50.875 --> 00:11:53.250
to the position of leadership.

230
00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.083
So if your duty itself

231
00:11:56.083 --> 00:11:59.958
is others' help, their progress, and then,

232
00:11:59.958 --> 00:12:03.791
through this, the organization's progress,

233
00:12:03.791 --> 00:12:07.166
then what ego in this?

234
00:12:07.166 --> 00:12:10.125
Just as jñānī knows the truth of life

235
00:12:10.125 --> 00:12:13.250
and world,

236
00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.833
you understand the truth of your duty.

237
00:12:16.833 --> 00:12:19.708
Just as they're away from selfishness,

238
00:12:19.708 --> 00:12:21.041
you also remain so.

239
00:12:21.041 --> 00:12:24.000
Just as they maintained patience,

240
00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:28.458
you also maintain patience. And just as they

241
00:12:28.458 --> 00:12:30.375
obtained the supreme level

242
00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:33.208
of spiritual progress,

243
00:12:33.208 --> 00:12:37.750
your professional progress will also be certain.
